 ,$ we have \n$-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}\\theta \\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{cos}\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ -4 & \\le 4\\operatorname{cos}\\theta \\le 4 \\\\ -4 & \\le x\\le 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $-4\\le x\\le 4.$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ notice that for $0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,$ we have \n$-1\\le \\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ -2 & \\le 2\\operatorname{sin}\\theta \\le 2 \\\\ -2 & \\le y\\le 2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $-2\\le y\\le 2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233838 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ba3839b9-52c3-5c2d-8eb0-66915070f5c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232653}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba3839b9-52c3-5c2d-8eb0-66915070f5c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232653} :answer-field/id #uuid "523ba8a1-21b9-506b-9e69-898d01fca170" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232652} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "874a3212-0376-540b-8ad7-1c3642cb863a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232655}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "874a3212-0376-540b-8ad7-1c3642cb863a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232655} :answer-field/id #uuid "64e564a7-8774-510d-802b-7a665e5a8cad" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232654} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "556377da-a872-595e-bb33-f1b354b23d8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232657}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "556377da-a872-595e-bb33-f1b354b23d8d" :answ